{"id":"aaa6b2c2f69bc3c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set.md","title":"ZFC Measure2 Caratheodory Measurable Set","display":"df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set — ZFC Measure2 Caratheodory Measurable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set","58-df-zfc-measure10-caratheodory-measurable-set","58-df-zfc-measure4-caratheodory-measurable","58-df-zfc-measure5-caratheodory-measurable-set","58-df-zfc-measure6-caratheodory-measurable","58-df-zfc-measure9-caratheodory-measurable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set — ZFC Measure2 Caratheodory Measurable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-caratheodory-measurable-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-caratheodory-measurable</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-caratheodory-measurable-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-caratheodory-measurable</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-caratheodory-measurable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set — ZFC Measure2 Caratheodory Measurable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\mu^\\ast\\in V\">\\(A,X,\\mu^\\ast\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (outer-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mu^\\ast)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^\\ast,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mu^\\ast(E)=\\mu^\\ast(E\\cap A)+\\mu^\\ast(E\\setminus A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mu^\\ast)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^\\ast,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mu^\\ast(E)=\\mu^\\ast(E\\cap A)+\\mu^\\ast(E\\setminus A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The equality is imposed for every set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\)</span>, exactly the Carathéodory splitting criterion for the registered outer measure.</li>\n<li>The measure10, measure4, measure5, and measure6 Caratheodory-measurable variants are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"4937f229fe78bb22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"4937f229fe78bb22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (outer-measure predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,X,\\mu^\\ast\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2CaratheodoryMeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mu^\\ast)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^\\ast,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mu^\\ast(E)=\\mu^\\ast(E\\cap A)+\\mu^\\ast(E\\setminus A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X","display":false}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2570","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set.md|58-df-zfc-measure2-caratheodory-measurable-set]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4937f229fe78bb22"]}